.TH "SKARN-RECENT" "1" "2026-06-23" "skarn 0.17.2" "Skarn Manual"
.SH NAME
skarn\-recent \- List recent sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskarn\fR \fBrecent\fR [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List recent sessions.
.PP
List and filter recent sessions.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-cli\fR \fIname\fR
Restrict to one assistant's sessions. One of: claude, gemini, codex, cursor,
copilot.
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR \fIpath\fR
Restrict to sessions whose project path contains this substring.
.TP
\fB\-\-worktree\fR \fIpath\fR
Restrict to sessions whose working directory is under this path.
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fIdate\fR
Lower bound of the time window; takes priority over \-\-hours.
.TP
\fB\-\-until\fR \fIdate\fR
Upper bound of the time window.
.TP
\fB\-\-tz\-offset\fR \fIminutes\fR
Timezone offset in minutes for date grouping and display. The default is 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-hours\fR \fIn\fR
Time window in hours; 0 means no limit. The default is 24.
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fIfmt\fR
Output format. One of: text, json, csv. The default is text.
.TP
\fB\-\-include\-empty\fR
Include sessions with no user or assistant messages (off by default).
